      "text": "1. when did the LLMs became large? is it because of transformers or because they were trained on a lot of data.\n2. embedding is the step where we find the coordinates of each token_id/integer so we can know where to put it as an input into neural network\n3. How many parts in transformers, are they only 2 or more?\n",
